Available LLMs:
  big [configured]
      runtimes: host, container-rootless, container-rootful
  claude-code (default) [configured]
      runtimes: host, container-rootless, container-rootful
  claude-fast [configured]
      runtimes: host, container-rootless, container-rootful
  mock [built-in]
      runtimes: host, container-rootless, container-rootful
  mock-launch [built-in]
      runtimes: host, container-rootless, container-rootful
  mock-lossy [built-in]
      runtimes: host, container-rootless, container-rootful
  mock-noskills [built-in]
      runtimes: host, container-rootless, container-rootful
  opencode [built-in]
      runtimes: host, container-rootless, container-rootful

[configured] declared in your config.yaml   [built-in] supplied by ctxloom
runtimes: the `agent create --runtime` values that engine can be given. There is
no default — an agent created without one inherits whatever the project says,
which is a default rather than a decision.